{"seq":10,"slug":"computational-geometry","title":"计算几何","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/computational-geometry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"geometry-basics","title":"计算几何基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/computational-geometry/geometry-basics","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"convex-hull","title":"凸包算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/computational-geometry/convex-hull","wordCount":1798,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"segment-intersection","title":"线段相交与扫描线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/computational-geometry/segment-intersection","wordCount":1834,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"closest-pair","title":"最近点对问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/computational-geometry/closest-pair","wordCount":1784,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"polygon-algorithms","title":"多边形算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/computational-geometry/polygon-algorithms","wordCount":1823,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"计算几何-简介\">计算几何 简介</h1><p>计算几何研究如何用算法高效地处理点、线、多边形等几何对象。它是计算机图形学、地理信息系统、机器人路径规划与游戏开发背后的数学引擎，也是算法竞赛中独具特色的一大门类。与连续的解析几何不同，计算几何强调离散、可计算的表达，并格外重视数值精度与算法效率——一个微小的浮点误差或一处未处理的退化情形，就可能让整个算法失效。</p>\n<p>本章从最基础的运算讲起，循序渐进地覆盖计算几何中最经典的几类问题。</p>\n<p><strong>计算几何基础</strong> 介绍点与向量的表示，以及点积和叉积这两个核心运算。叉积的方向判定是后续几乎所有算法的基石，本节还特别强调整数运算与退化情形处理对几何代码正确性的决定性影响。</p>\n<p><strong>凸包算法</strong> 求包含点集的最小凸多边形。本节详解 Graham 扫描法与 Andrew 单调链法两种经典解法，分析它们如何借助叉积转向判定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时间内构造凸包，以及凸包作为众多几何问题预处理步骤的价值。</p>\n<p><strong>线段相交与扫描线</strong> 从用叉积做跨立实验判断两线段是否相交出发，引入扫描线这一计算几何的重要范式。本节剖析扫描线如何把二维相交问题局部化为相邻线段之间的检查，从而将暴力的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 优化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((n+k)\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>最近点对问题</strong> 是分治思想的经典范例。本节展示如何按横坐标均分点集、递归求解，再利用几何性质在线性时间内合并跨界点对，把暴力的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>多边形算法</strong> 介绍三类处理区域的经典算法——鞋带公式求面积、射线法判断点是否在多边形内，以及旋转卡壳求凸多边形直径，展示计算几何如何从&quot;点线&quot;走向&quot;区域&quot;。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序学习。第一节的叉积与方向判定是理解全章的钥匙，凸包则是后续多个算法的共同基础；线段相交与最近点对分别展示了扫描线与分治两种范式，多边形算法则把这些工具综合运用到实际区域问题中。阅读时不妨始终留意一条主线：计算几何的上层算法，几乎都建立在叉积这一基础运算和对精度、退化情形的审慎处理之上。</p>\n"}